<title>BELGIUM: Clabecq says to file for bankruptcy.</title>
<headline>Clabecq says to file for bankruptcy.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Walloon region, majority shareholder in loss-making steel firm Forges de Clabecq, has decided to withdraw its support for the company and the company will file for bankruptcy on Friday, a Clabecq spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
